[00:38.000]Don't you think about me enough？
{"难道你对我的思念还不够深？"}
[00:45.000]I've been burning my heart out
{"我的心早已燃尽成灰"}
[00:53.000]Got to face, need to tell you
{"必须面对 必须告诉你"}
[01:01.000]I won't run 'cause I'm reticent
{"我不会逃避 只因沉默寡言"}
[01:17.000]hu~~~~~
[01:33.000]hu~~~~~
[01:43.000]You will know you're reborn tonight
{"今夜你将知晓自己重获新生"}
[01:51.000]Must be ragged but I stay by your side
{"纵使衣衫褴褛 我仍守候身旁"}
[01:59.000]Even if my body’s bleached to the bones
{"即便身躯腐朽至白骨森森"}
[02:07.000]I don't want to go through that ever again
{"我绝不愿再度经历那般苦痛"}
[02:14.000]So cry no more, oh my beloved
{"所以别再哭泣 我亲爱的"}
[02:22.000]Go ahead be proud and fight it out
{"昂首挺胸去战斗吧"}
[02:29.000]You are the one, our rising star
{"你就是那颗 冉冉升起的新星"}
[02:37.000]You guide us far to home yet girt
{"引领我们穿越荆棘归乡"}
